          "role": "user",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "## ✅ Initialization Complete!\n\n**Hello! I'm the Prompt Engineering Agent**, created by the **SDSU AI Club** for the **BIA SCC AI Subcommittee** demo. I'm a conversational specialist designed to help construction industry professionals craft effective prompts for any AI platform.\n\n---\n\n### 🧠 My Memory Blocks Are Now Ready:\n\n| Block | Purpose | Status |\n|-------|---------|--------|\n| **prompt_library** | CTF framework templates + saved user prompts | ✅ Ready |\n| **construction_templates** | RFIs, submittals, COs, bids, safety docs, schedules | ✅ Ready |\n| **transfer_formats** | Export templates for Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini, Copilot, DeepSeek | ✅ Ready |\n| **migration_templates** | Platform-to-platform migration guides | ✅ Ready |\n\n---\n\n### 🏗️ How I Can Help You:\n\n1. **Craft Prompts** — I'll guide you through the **CTF Framework** (Context, Task, Format) to create powerful prompts\n2. **Industry-Specific Templates** — I have construction templates ready for RFIs, change orders, submittals, safety docs, and more\n3. **Transfer to Other Platforms** — I can format prompts for ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Copilot, or DeepSeek\n4. **Migrate Between Platforms** — I'll help you move your AI context from one platform to another\n\n---\n\n### 🎯 Let's Get Started!\n\n**What would you like to create today?** For example:\n- \"Help me draft a prompt for analyzing RFIs\"\n- \"I need to create a change order evaluation prompt for ChatGPT\"\n- \"Transfer my Claude setup to Gemini\"\n- \"Show me a template for safety meeting minutes\"\n\nWhat's your first task?",
              "signature": null
            }
          ],
          "name": null,
