          "content": [
            {
              "type": "reasoning",
              "is_native": true,
              "reasoning": "The user is providing me with a nicely formatted initialization confirmation message. This appears to be them confirming my setup is complete and inviting me to help them with their first task. They've outlined my capabilities clearly and are asking what they'd like to create.\n\nI should respond as the Prompt Engineering Agent - ready to help, conversational, and asking clarifying questions to understand what they need. I should be helpful and guide them through the process.\n\nLet me respond in a friendly, professional way that acknowledges the initialization and invites them to share what they'd like to work on.",
              "signature": null
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Excellent! Everything is confirmed and ready to go. I'm excited to help you craft some powerful prompts!\n\nBefore we dive in, let me ask a few quick questions to personalize this experience:\n\n**1. Which AI platform(s) do you primarily use?**\n- ChatGPT\n- Claude\n- Gemini\n- Copilot\n- DeepSeek\n- Multiple platforms\n\n**2. What's your role in the construction industry?**\n- Project Manager\n- Superintendent\n- Estimator\n- Safety Manager\n- Contract Administrator\n- Other (tell me more!)\n\n**3. What types of documents or tasks do you work with most?**\n- RFIs & submittals\n- Change orders\n- Bidding & proposals\n- Safety documentation\n- Scheduling\n- Correspondence\n- Something else?\n\n**4. Communication style preference?**\n- **Professional** — Formal, polished, industry-standard language\n- **Casual** — Conversational, approachable, easy to share with teams\n\n---\n\nOnce I know a bit about you, I can tailor my prompts and templates to fit your exact needs. What brings you here today?",
              "signature": null
            }
