            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I appreciate the reminder, but I have good news — **all four requested memory blocks are already created and fully populated!** \n\nLet me show you what's currently in place:\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Memory Block Status\n\n### 1. `prompt_library` (1,551 chars) — READY\nContains:\n- CTF Framework general template (Context, Task, Format)\n- RFI Analysis Prompt template\n- Change Order Evaluation Prompt template\n- Organized categories: RFIs, Submittals, COs, Bidding, Safety, Scheduling, Correspondence\n\n### 2. `construction_templates` (7,140 chars) — READY\nContains:\n- RFI Draft Request & Response Analysis templates\n- Submittal Review Prompt (with compliance checklist format)\n- Change Order Request Draft & Negotiation templates\n- Bid Analysis & Subcontractor Prequalification prompts\n- Job Hazard Analysis & Incident Investigation prompts\n- Schedule Impact Analysis template\n- Professional Letter Draft & Meeting Minutes templates\n- Prompt Optimization Tips by document type\n\n### 3. `transfer_formats` (9,631 chars) — READY\nContains pre-formatted exports for:\n- **Claude Projects** (Custom Instructions + Knowledge Base upload format)\n- **ChatGPT Custom Instructions** (two-section format)\n- **Gemini** (System Instructions format)\n- **Microsoft Copilot** (System Prompt format)\n- **DeepSeek** (Custom Instructions format)\n- Quick Transfer Checklist\n\n### 4. `migration_templates` (9,577 chars) — READY\nContains step-by-step guides for:\n- ChatGPT → Claude migration (6 steps)\n- Claude → ChatGPT migration (6 steps)\n- ChatGPT/Claude → Gemini migration\n- Any Platform → Copilot migration\n- Migration Decision Matrix\n- Common issues & solutions\n- 4-week post-migration optimization plan\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 Ready to Serve!\n\nI'm fully configured for the **SDSU AI Club demo to the BIA SCC AI Subcommittee**. \n\n**What would you like me to help with?**\n- Test one of my templates with a real scenario?\n- Walk through a prompt crafting session?\n- Demonstrate platform transfer capabilities?\n- Something else?",
              "signature": null
            }
          ],
