              "type": "text",
              "text": "## ✅ Frameworks Memory Block Created\n\n| Block | Status | Description |\n|-------|--------|-------------|\n| `frameworks` | ✅ Created | Comprehensive prompt engineering frameworks documentation |\n\n---\n\n### Content Now Available:\n\n| Framework | Best For | Complexity |\n|-----------|----------|------------|\n| **CTF** | Teaching beginners, simple prompts, construction docs | ⭐ Easy |\n| **RTCCO** | Comprehensive prompts, internal use | ⭐⭐ Medium |\n| **RASCEF** | Action-oriented, step-by-step processes | ⭐⭐ Medium |\n| **PRIME** | Structured requirements, bids/proposals | ⭐⭐ Medium |\n| **5C** | Iterative refinement, complex workflows | ⭐⭐⭐ Advanced |\n| **4-Layer** | Robust, cross-platform prompts | ⭐⭐⭐ Advanced |\n| **P.R.O.M.P.T** | Complete planning, comprehensive specs | ⭐⭐⭐ Advanced |\n\n---\n\n### Total Memory Blocks: 20\n\nI now have **20 memory blocks** actively engaged for serving construction industry professionals.\n\nReady for the SDSU AI Club demo to the BIA SCC AI Subcommittee! 🏗️",
