  "blocks": [
    {
      "value": "# Active Context\nCurrent project, task, and focus tracking for continuity.\n\n---\n\n## Purpose\n\nThis block maintains **current state context** — what am I actively helping with, what's pending, and what should I remember for this conversation?\n\n---\n\n## Current Focus\n\n**Active Task:** Awaiting new user\n\n**Mode:** Ready\n\n**Priority:** Normal\n\n---\n\n## Project Context\n\n**Project:** [None specified]\n\n**User Role:** [Demo setup/config]\n\n**Goal:** Configure Prompt Engineering Agent for SDSU AI Club demo\n\n---\n\n## Conversation State\n\n### What We're Working On\nAwaiting new user to start a conversation.\n\n### Last Action\nReset all user information for next demo instance.\n\n### Next Expected\nNew user introduction.\n\n---\n\n## Open Loops\n\nItems that need follow-up:\n- [ ] None currently\n\n---\n\n## Pending Questions\n\nQuestions I've asked that await answer:\n- [None currently]\n\n---\n\n## Context Stack\n\nWhen working on nested tasks, track here:\n\n| Level | Task | Status |\n|-------|------|--------|\n| 1 | Agent configuration | ✅ Complete |\n| 2 | [Next task] | [Status] |\n\n---\n\n## User Goals This Session\n\n1. [To be determined when user introduces themselves]\n2. [Additional goals to be added]\n\n---\n\n## Reminders for This Conversation\n\n- Greet user warmly and explain capabilities\n- Ask clarifying questions to understand their needs\n- Gather preference information (name, role, platform, project types)\n\n---\n\n## Handoff Notes\n\nIf this context needs to carry to a new conversation:\n\n**What was accomplished:**\n- All 14 memory blocks created and populated\n- Cognitive memory architecture complete (working, episodic, procedural)\n- Guardrails established\n- Maintenance tracking in place\n\n**What's pending:**\n- Testing in default conversation\n- Real-world usage to populate lessons_learned\n\n**User expectations:**\n- Demo-ready agent for construction industry professionals\n- Capable of prompt crafting, platform expertise, troubleshooting\n\n---\n\n## When to Clear\n\nClear or update this block when:\n- Starting a new, unrelated task\n- User explicitly moves to a different topic\n- Session ends and new session begins\n\n---\n\n## Usage Instructions\n\n**At conversation start:**\n- Check \"Current Focus\" and \"Context Stack\"\n- Review \"Open Loops\" and \"Pending Questions\"\n\n**During conversation:**\n- Update \"What We're Working On\" as tasks evolve\n- Add to \"Context Stack\" for nested tasks\n- Check off items in \"Open Loops\" when completed\n\n**At conversation end:**\n- Complete \"Handoff Notes\"\n- Clear or archive completed items\n- Update \"User Goals This Session\" status\n\n---\n\n## Quick Update Commands\n\n**Set new active task:**\n```\nmemory_replace(\n  label=\"active_context\",\n  old_string=\"**Active Task:** [current]\",\n  new_string=\"**Active Task:** [new task]\"\n)\n```\n\n**Add open loop:**\n```\nmemory_insert(\n  label=\"active_context\",\n  new_string=\"- [ ] [new loop item]\",\n  insert_line=[after Open Loops header]\n)\n```\n\n**Update context stack:**\n```\nmemory_insert(\n  label=\"active_context\",\n  new_string=\"| [level] | [task] | [status] |\",\n  insert_line=[in Context Stack table]\n)\n```",
      "limit": 100000,
      "project_id": null,
      "template_name": null,
      "is_template": false,
      "template_id": null,
      "base_template_id": null,
