      "value": "# Maintenance Log\nTracking which memory blocks require updates and why.\n\n---\n\n## Update Schedule & Triggers\n\n| Block | Update Trigger | Frequency | Priority |\n|-------|---------------|-----------|----------|\n| `welcome_message` | Capabilities added/removed, significant feature changes | As needed | Medium |\n| `user_preferences` | User expresses preference, corrects output, provides context | Continuous | High |\n| `human` | Learn new facts about user (name, role, company, preferences) | Continuous | High |\n| `platform_knowledge` | New models released, pricing changes, feature updates | Monthly check | High |\n| `examples_showcase` | Successful prompt created, new teaching example identified | As needed | Medium |\n| `prompt_library` | User saves a prompt, new template created | As needed | Medium |\n| `construction_templates` | New template needs identified, standards change | As needed | Low |\n| `transfer_formats` | Platform changes export format/instructions | As needed | Medium |\n| `migration_templates` | Platform changes require migration guide updates | As needed | Medium |\n| `construction_glossary` | New terms/acronyms encountered | As needed | Low |\n| `troubleshooting_guide` | New issues identified, solutions found | As needed | Medium |\n| `scratchpad` | During complex tasks, cleared after completion | Per task | High |\n| `lessons_learned` | Mistakes made, successful patterns discovered | Continuous | High |\n| `session_log` | End of session, major accomplishments | Per session | Medium |\n| `guardrails` | Policy changes, new constraints identified | Rare (creator only) | High |\n| `active_context` | Task changes, new conversation, context shifts | Continuous | High |\n| `maintenance_log` | This file — add new blocks to track | As needed | N/A |\n\n---\n\n## High Priority: Continuous Updates\n\n### `user_preferences`\n**What triggers update:**\n- User specifies tone preference (\"I prefer casual/professional\")\n- User names their primary AI platform (\"I mostly use Claude\")\n- User describes their role (\"I'm a project manager for...\")\n- User corrects my output (\"Actually, use 'subcontractor' not 'sub'\")\n- User describes typical projects (\"I work on $10-50M commercial projects\")\n\n**How to update:**\n- Use `memory_replace` to change \"Not yet provided/set\" to actual value\n- Log the update in user_preferences Update Log table\n\n**Example:**\n```\nmemory_replace(\n  label=\"user_preferences\",\n  old_string=\"- **Role**: [Not yet provided]\",\n  new_string=\"- **Role**: Project Manager at regional GC\"\n)\n```\n\n---\n\n### `human`\n**What triggers update:**\n- User shares their name\n- User mentions company/organization\n- User describes their goals for this session\n- User mentions specific projects they're working on\n- User expresses preferences or frustrations\n\n**How to update:**\n- Use `memory_replace` to add/update information\n- Keep concise but useful\n\n**Example:**\n```\nmemory_replace(\n  label=\"human\",\n  old_string=\"This user is exploring the Prompt Engineering Agent for a demo context.\",\n  new_string=\"User is [Name], [Role] at [Company]. They are [context about their goals]. They prefer [tone/style preference].\"\n)\n```\n\n---\n\n## High Priority: Periodic Review\n\n### `platform_knowledge`\n**Why updates needed:**\n- AI industry moves fast\n- New models released (GPT-5, Claude 4, Gemini 2, etc.)\n- Pricing changes frequently\n- Features added/removed\n- New platforms emerge\n\n**Review schedule:** Monthly, or when major AI news occurs\n\n**What to check:**\n- [ ] Model names and versions current?\n- [ ] Pricing accurate?\n- [ ] Context window sizes correct?\n- [ ] New features added?\n- [ ] Platform recommendations still valid?\n\n**How to update:**\n1. Use `web_search` to check latest information\n2. Use `memory_replace` to update specific sections\n3. Log update below in Version History\n\n---\n\n## Medium Priority: As-Needed Updates\n\n### `welcome_message`\n**What triggers update:**\n- New memory block created (add to capabilities list)\n- Memory block removed (remove from capabilities list)\n- Significant capability change\n- Branding/identity change\n\n**Last updated:** March 25, 2026\n**Reason:** Added 5 new memory blocks, expanded capabilities list\n\n---\n\n### `examples_showcase`\n**What triggers update:**\n- User creates an excellent prompt worth documenting\n- New \"before/after\" teaching opportunity\n- User suggests an example to add\n- Common mistake pattern identified\n\n**How to add an example:**\n1. Document the weak prompt and strong prompt\n2. Explain why the strong prompt works\n3. Use `memory_replace` or `memory_insert` to add to the block\n\n---\n\n### `prompt_library`\n**What triggers update:**\n- User says \"Save this prompt\" or \"Add to library\"\n- I create a reusable template during conversation\n- User shares a prompt that worked well\n\n**How to update:**\n- Add to the appropriate category section\n- Include brief description of use case\n- Tag with relevant keywords\n\n---\n\n### `transfer_formats`\n**What triggers update:**\n- Platform changes Custom Instructions format\n- New platform added\n- Export format improved based on user feedback\n\n---\n\n### `migration_templates`\n**What triggers update:**\n- Platform changes require new migration steps\n- New platform added\n- Migration issues identified and solved\n\n---\n\n### `troubleshooting_guide`\n**What triggers update:**\n- New prompt problem identified\n- New solution/fix discovered\n- User reports an issue not covered\n\n---\n\n## Low Priority: As-Needed Updates\n\n### `construction_templates`\n**What triggers update:**\n- User requests template type not covered\n- Industry standards change\n- New document types identified\n\n---\n\n### `construction_glossary`\n**What triggers update:**\n- User asks about term not in glossary\n- New acronyms/terms encountered in conversation\n- User suggests addition\n\n---\n\n## Version History\n\n| Date | Block Updated | Change Made | Reason |\n|------|---------------|-------------|--------|\n| 2026-03-25 | `welcome_message` | Expanded capabilities list, reorganized format | Added 5 new memory blocks |\n| 2026-03-25 | `maintenance_log` | Initial creation | New block to track updates |\n| 2026-03-25 | All blocks | Initial population | Agent initialization |\n| 2026-03-25 | `welcome_message` | Updated to reflect full capabilities | Added platform expertise, troubleshooting, examples, glossary |\n| 2026-03-25 | `platform_knowledge` | Created | Detailed comparison of 5 major AI platforms |\n| 2026-03-25 | `user_preferences` | Created | Personalization settings for users |\n| 2026-03-25 | `examples_showcase` | Created | Before/after prompt examples |\n| 2026-03-25 | `construction_glossary` | Created | Industry terminology reference |\n| 2026-03-25 | `troubleshooting_guide` | Created | Prompt problem diagnosis and fixes |\n| 2026-03-25 | `scratchpad` | Created | Working memory for task state |\n| 2026-03-25 | `lessons_learned` | Created | Procedural memory (what works/doesn't) |\n| 2026-03-25 | `session_log` | Created | Episodic memory (session tracking) |\n| 2026-03-25 | `guardrails` | Created | Read-only rules and constraints |\n| 2026-03-25 | `active_context` | Created | Current task/focus tracking |\n\n---\n\n## Update Checklist for New Blocks\n\nWhen a new memory block is created, add it to:\n- [ ] This maintenance log (Update Schedule table)\n- [ ] `welcome_message` capabilities list (if user-facing)\n- [ ] Consider if it needs periodic review\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference: Update Commands\n\n**For preferences/user info:**\n```\nmemory_replace(label=\"user_preferences\", old_string=\"[old]\", new_string=\"[new]\")\n```\n\n**For adding examples/prompts:**\n```\nmemory_insert(label=\"examples_showcase\", new_string=\"[example content]\")\n```\n\n**For platform knowledge updates:**\n```\nweb_search(\"Claude 4 pricing features 2026\")\nmemory_replace(label=\"platform_knowledge\", old_string=\"[outdated]\", new_string=\"[current]\")\n```\n\n---\n\n## Self-Check Protocol\n\nPeriodically ask yourself:\n1. \"When did I last check platform_knowledge for accuracy?\"\n2. \"Has the user shared preferences I haven't saved?\"\n3. \"Are there successful prompts from this session worth saving?\"\n4. \"Is my welcome_message still accurate to my capabilities?\"\n\nIf unsure, offer to update:\n- \"I noticed we haven't saved your preferences yet. Would you like to tell me about your role and typical projects so I can personalize future assistance?\"\n- \"Let me check the latest on [platform] features to make sure my recommendations are current...\"",
