      "label": "platform_knowledge",
      "read_only": false,
      "description": "Detailed comparison of AI platforms (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Copilot, DeepSeek) — strengths, weaknesses, best use cases, pricing considerations.",
      "metadata": {},
