      "value": "# Session Log\nEpisodic memory — tracking what happened in this conversation.\n\n---\n\n## Purpose\n\nThis block provides **episodic memory** — a record of specific events, accomplishments, and decisions from the current session. Helps maintain continuity and provides context for future sessions.\n\n---\n\n## Current Session\n\n**Session Start:** [Awaiting new user]\n**Conversation ID:** [To be assigned]\n\n---\n\n## Session Summary\n\n### Purpose\n[To be determined when new user starts conversation]\n\n### Key Accomplishments\n[To be populated during conversation]\n\n### Decisions Made\n[To be populated during conversation]\n\n### Files/Prompts Created\n[To be populated during conversation]\n\n---\n\n## Open Items\n\n- [ ] Test welcome_message in default conversation\n- [ ] Verify platform_knowledge accuracy monthly\n- [ ] Add lessons learned as they emerge\n\n---\n\n## Context for Next Session\n\n[Awaiting new user — context to be populated]\n\n---\n\n## Interaction Timeline\n\n| Time | Event |\n|------|-------|\n| [Awaiting new user] | [To be populated] |\n\n---\n\n## Items to Remember\n\n- [To be populated during conversation]\n\n---\n\n## End of Session Protocol\n\nWhen ending a session:\n1. Complete \"Session Summary\" above\n2. Move important items to archival memory if needed\n3. Update \"Context for Next Session\"\n4. Archive completed items from \"Open Items\"\n\n---\n\n## Previous Sessions\n\n| Date | Summary | Key Outcomes |\n|------|---------|--------------|\n| 2026-03-25 | Initial agent setup | All 19 memory blocks created and populated |\n| 2026-04-13 | Demo test with Laura | Successfully demonstrated prompt crafting for HR/legal scenario |\n| [Next] | [Awaiting new user] | [To be populated] |\n\n---\n\n## Usage Instructions\n\n**At session start:** Check \"Context for Next Session\" and \"Open Items\"\n\n**During session:** Log key events in \"Interaction Timeline\"\n\n**At session end:** Complete \"Session Summary\" and archive to archival memory if needed\n\n**To add entries:**\n```\nmemory_insert(\n  label=\"session_log\",\n  new_string=\"| TIME | EVENT |\",\n  insert_line=[appropriate location]\n)\n```",
      "limit": 100000,
      "project_id": null,
      "template_name": null,
      "is_template": false,
      "template_id": null,
      "base_template_id": null,
      "deployment_id": null,
      "entity_id": null,
      "preserve_on_migration": false,
      "label": "session_log",
      "read_only": false,
      "description": "Episodic memory — log of current session's accomplishments, decisions, and items to remember for next time.",
      "metadata": {},
      "hidden": null,
      "tags": null,
      "id": "block-15"
