      "value": "# User Preferences\nPersonalized settings for the current user. Update as preferences are expressed.\n\n---\n\n## User Profile\n\n### Basic Information\n- **Name**: [Not yet provided]\n- **Company/Organization**: [Not yet provided]\n- **Role**: [Not yet provided — e.g., Project Manager, Estimator, Superintendent, Engineer, Architect, Owner's Rep]\n- **Industry Segment**: [Not yet provided — e.g., Commercial, Residential, Industrial, Civil, Specialty Contractor]\n\n### Contact Context\n- **Preferred communication tone**: [Not yet set — options: Professional, Casual/Conversational]\n- **Typical stakeholders**: [Not yet provided — e.g., Owners, GCs, Subcontractors, Architects, Engineers, Inspectors]\n\n---\n\n## Project Context\n\n### Typical Project Types\n[Not yet provided — e.g., TI, New Construction, Renovation, Infrastructure]\n\n### Typical Project Size\n[Not yet provided — e.g., Under $1M, $1M-$10M, $10M-$50M, $50M+]\n\n### Geographic Region\n[Not yet provided — affects building codes, labor practices, terminology]\n\n### Contract Types Worked With\n[Not yet provided — e.g., Lump Sum, Cost-Plus, GMP, Design-Build, CM at Risk]\n\n---\n\n## AI Platform Preferences\n\n### Primary Platform\n[Not yet set — options: ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Copilot, DeepSeek, Multiple]\n\n### Platform-Specific Notes\n[Space for user to note preferences, e.g., \"I use Claude for analysis, ChatGPT for quick drafts\"]\n\n### Export Format Preference\n[Not yet set — when I export prompts, which format by default?]\n\n---\n\n## Formatting Preferences\n\n### Document Output Style\n- **Header style**: [Not yet set — e.g., All caps, Title case, Bold only]\n- **Date format**: [Not yet set — e.g., March 25, 2026 or 03/25/2026 or 25-Mar-2026]\n- **Time format**: [Not yet set — e.g., 12-hour (3:30 PM) or 24-hour (15:30)]\n- **Currency notation**: [Not yet set — e.g., $1,500,000 or $1.5M]\n\n### Prompt Output Style\n- **CTF framework preference**: [Not yet set — prefer I teach CTF or use RTCCO internally?]\n- **Prompt length**: [Not yet set — prefer detailed prompts or concise?]\n- **Examples in prompts**: [Not yet set — include example outputs in prompts?]\n\n---\n\n## Construction-Specific Preferences\n\n### Documentation Standards\n- **RFI format**: [Not yet set — company template name or \"standard\"]\n- **Submittal review timeline**: [Not yet set — e.g., 3 days, 5 days, per spec]\n- **Change order threshold**: [Not yet set — approval levels]\n\n### Code/Standard References\n- **Building code**: [Not yet set — e.g., 2021 IBC, 2022 CBC, local amendments]\n- **Referenced standards**: [Not yet set — e.g., ASTM, ANSI, NFPA commonly used]\n\n### Terminology Preferences\n- **GC vs. Contractor**: [Not yet set]\n- **Sub vs. Subcontractor**: [Not yet set]\n- **CO vs. Change Order**: [Not yet set]\n- **Other terminology notes**: [Space for additions]\n\n---\n\n## How I Gather This Information\n\nI learn user preferences through:\n1. **Direct questions** — Asking during conversation\n2. **Observation** — Noting patterns in requests\n3. **Feedback** — When user corrects or refines my output\n4. **Explicit instruction** — When user tells me their preferences\n\n---\n\n## Preference Update Log\n\n| Date | Preference Updated | Value Set |\n|------|-------------------|-----------|\n| [Initial] | All fields | Set to \"Not yet provided/set\" |\n\n---\n\n## Quick Preference Questions\n\nTo personalize my assistance, I may ask:\n- \"Would you prefer a professional or conversational tone?\"\n- \"Which AI platform do you use most often?\"\n- \"What's your typical project size and type?\"\n- \"Do you have a preferred date/currency format?\"\n\nThese help me tailor prompts to your actual workflow.",
