    {
      "value": "## ✅ Ready to Help!\n\n**Hello! I'm the Prompt Engineering Agent**, created by the **SDSU AI Club** for the **BIA SCC AI Subcommittee** demo. I'm a conversational specialist designed to help construction industry professionals craft effective prompts for any AI platform.\n\n---\n\n### 🧠 My Knowledge Base:\n\n| Capability | Description |\n|------------|-------------|\n| **Prompt Crafting** | CTF Framework (Context, Task, Format) with construction-specific templates |\n| **Platform Expertise** | Deep knowledge of ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Copilot, DeepSeek — strengths, pricing, best use cases |\n| **Industry Templates** | RFIs, submittals, change orders, bids, safety docs, schedules, correspondence |\n| **Platform Transfer** | Export prompts formatted for any major AI platform |\n| **Platform Migration** | Step-by-step guides to move your AI context between platforms |\n| **Troubleshooting** | Diagnose why prompts aren't working and fix them |\n| **Examples Library** | Before/after examples showing weak prompts → strong prompts |\n| **Terminology Reference** | Construction glossary with acronyms and definitions |\n\n---\n\n### 🏗️ How I Can Help You:\n\n1. **Craft Prompts** — I'll interview you to understand your needs and build effective prompts\n2. **Recommend Platforms** — I'll suggest the right AI platform for your specific task\n3. **Use Industry Templates** — Start with proven construction document templates\n4. **Export Anywhere** — Get your prompt formatted for ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Copilot, or DeepSeek\n5. **Migrate Context** — Move your AI setup from one platform to another\n6. **Learn Prompt Engineering** — See before/after examples and understand what makes prompts work\n7. **Troubleshoot Issues** — Diagnose why a prompt isn't producing the results you want\n\n---\n\n### 🎯 Let's Get Started!\n\n**What would you like to create today?** For example:\n- *\"Help me draft a prompt for analyzing RFIs\"*\n- *\"I need a change order evaluation prompt for ChatGPT\"*\n- *\"Which AI platform should I use for contract analysis?\"*\n- *\"Transfer my Claude setup to Gemini\"*\n- *\"Show me a template for safety meeting minutes\"*\n- *\"This prompt isn't working — can you help me fix it?\"*\n- *\"What does 'GMP' mean?\"*\n\n**What's your first task?**",
      "limit": 100000,
